Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:04.44,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Well, apparently I've discovered that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:07.52,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I can take these yawn-filled days
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.48,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And turn them into movies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:13.49,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I've found the secret and trick to it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.45,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Under this sky where we don't get along
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:19.54,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I closed my heart and locked it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:22.58,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That's how I've managed to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:24.58,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And the melodies now overlap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:31.34,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I wanted a sign, no matter how small
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:38.26,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That I could actually find \Nbetter than any streetlight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:45.14,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I put a ribbon on each of the \Nsights that my eyes pick out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:51.07,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And I collect them like souvenirs \Nas I continue down this path home
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.07,0:00:57.07,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,The seasons each say hello, \Nand I shed a few tears as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:01:03.33,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Where should I begin to talk about \Nthis way home that you've given me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:11.46,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I walk and walk and sometimes \Nrush on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:23.64,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I run and run, wait, no, I should \Nstill walk on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:32.98,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(305,160)\fscx60}THE UNWAVERING PATH
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:41.62,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The Phony pair just can't be stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.03,0:01:43.24,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:47.87,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Carrol's hit just went in a crazy angle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.51,0:01:58.30,italics,Carrol,0,0,0,,Damn it. Time for the next plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:00.43,italics,Carrol,0,0,0,,Adjust the net's height.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.31,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Twilight...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.31,0:02:12.36,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:14.61,main,Twain,0,0,0,,It's moving up and down \Nby about a ball's height.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.61,0:02:17.53,main,Twain,0,0,0,,We'll correct our trajectory \Ncalculations and strike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:23.58,main,Kim,0,0,0,,That's not working at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:25.29,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Then we'll just have to use some wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:33.25,main,Kim,0,0,0,,Hey! They're just using \Nit to their advantage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:33.84,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:38.26,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Campbell siblings use one method \Nafter another to try to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:40.88,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Damn it! Douse the ball with \Nthe putrid-stench spray!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:42.85,main,Kim,0,0,0,,That's gonna reek for us, too, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:47.73,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,But they were nothing more than child's play to\N the pair of spies who had found their groove.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:53.23,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Your observation skills, judgment, \Nand control are all perfect, Nafalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:55.90,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I'm glad I have you playing by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.03,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Darling...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:02:59.57,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,We are now entering our final set!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:01.99,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Which pair will take home the glory?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:01.57,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:04.74,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I want this tournament to continue forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:08.91,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll force a tiebreaker \Nthat goes on forever... No, Nafalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.91,0:03:11.87,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,That'll make Twilight hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.87,0:03:15.34,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I almost forgot how I felt in the beginning,\N even though he just reminded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:16.63,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:18.13,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,Nightfall...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:20.26,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,Looks like she's carefully \Nthinking up a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:22.51,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,It appears as though she's regained her cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:24.85,italics,Cabi,0,0,0,,What do you two think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:27.72,italics,Cabi,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how much \Nthis match is going to cost me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:30.81,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Tch. Guess we're gonna have \Nto use our trump card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:37.16,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,Did they give up their petty tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.28,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,He lobbed it nicely into the air. This ends it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.28,italics,Carrol,0,0,0,,Nyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:42.57,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,A new signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:51.37,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Nightfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:57.38,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Twi—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:04.47,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,What's this? Twain just suddenly pounced \Nonto his wife and took them both down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:09.10,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Hey, now. Could you old farts spare \Nus the snuggling during our match?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:12.23,italics,Carrol,0,0,0,,Did he sense it before the \Nshot was taken? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:14.77,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Darling... Darling, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:18.52,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:20.90,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Darling...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.65,0:04:24.53,main,Twain,0,0,0,,It's a special rubber bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:26.66,main,Twain,0,0,0,,There's a sniper somewhere in the air ducts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:30.16,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Look. They even painted the bullet \Nthe same color as the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:34.29,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry. This happened \Nbecause of my carelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:39.42,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I figured something like this might happen,\N so I wore a bulletproof vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:40.92,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Impressive as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:44.38,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,The fact that he even considered this \Npossibility makes him the best, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:49.31,italics,Carrol,0,0,0,,Impossible! He's unharmed?! \NIt hit him, didn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:52.24,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,This interference has \Ndefinitely gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:55.23,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should talk to the umpire\N and see about having a penalty issued.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:58.36,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Depending on where the victim is shot, \Nthat could be lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:04:59.57,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:03.24,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure most of the staff and \Nmanagement are in Campbell's pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:05.78,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Not to mention, if something \Nhappens to the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:08.49,main,Twain,0,0,0,,and we lose our chance to get the painting,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.49,0:05:10.03,main,Twain,0,0,0,,that would be a huge blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:12.79,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Thankfully, these are low-velocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:15.29,main,Twain,0,0,0,,If we purposely leave enough \Nroom and shift our timing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:17.12,main,Twain,0,0,0,,we can make them miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.96,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Don't miss their signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:19.96,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I will do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:22.38,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Are you two all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:26.05,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. I'm still a \Nbit hungover from yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:27.34,main,Twain,0,0,0,,and I lost my balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:28.72,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Th-That can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:34.43,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Unbelievable! Twain has been pulling off \Nthose elegant plays while hungover!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:31.64,top,Twain,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:38.06,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,And now, let's continue the match!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:39.70,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Nyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:41.86,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,So they're going to target \Nme right as I'm serving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:47.91,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Look at Twain's bizarre footwork and serve!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:49.78,main,Sniper,0,0,0,,Damn it... I missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:51.78,italicstop,Commentator,0,0,0,,Is he starting to feel drunk yet again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:53.54,main,Sniper,0,0,0,,Court engineering squad, we need \Nto work together and distract them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:57.29,sign_8477_99_Missing,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(110,110)}Floor Dent Team
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:57.29,sign_8477_99_Missing,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(132,180)\fscx80}Net Raising/Lowering Team
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:57.29,sign_8477_99_Missing,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(94,245)\fscx80}Wind-Blowing Team
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:57.29,sign_8477_99_Missing,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(503,95)\fscx80}Sniper Team
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:56.37,main,Sniper,0,0,0,,We must make sure the young master \Nand lady win at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.29,main,Minions,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:03.46,italicstop,Commentator,0,0,0,,Looks like Nafalia is feeling \Na little drunk herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:02.38,main,Sniper,0,0,0,,Why can't I hit them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:05.34,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Was the couple drinking \Ntogether into the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:08.59,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,Their overconfidence is making \Nthem very easy to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:11.18,main,Sniper,0,0,0,,Team BB! We need you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:13.31,italics,Sniper,0,0,0,,Just don't let the crowd \Nor the umpires catch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.47,0:06:15.18,main,No.1,0,0,0,,Number 1 here. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:16.31,main,No.2,0,0,0,,Number 2, roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:17.52,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Here they come, Nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.56,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Yes, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:20.56,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,Really? Even the ball boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:24.27,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Twain just whiffed the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:25.53,main,No. 1,0,0,0,,He parried?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:26.69,italics,No. 2,0,0,0,,He did that to mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:28.95,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Looks like two more are getting in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:33.08,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Yes. But unlike the sniper we can't see,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:35.49,main,Twain,0,0,0,,we can see their gazes and the \Nmovement of their fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.49,0:06:36.70,main,Twain,0,0,0,,They're no match for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.21,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Let's go ahead and finish this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:43.21,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The Phony pair is making absolutely \Nincomprehensible movements!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:46.34,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Is this what they call the \Ndrunken fist in the far east?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:51.80,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Stop them, Carrol and Kim! \NYou have to stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.23,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:03.71,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. Looks like the milk I drank\N this morning had gone bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:07.57,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Apparently, Carrol has been \Nplaying through a stomachache!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:09.57,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,This is a pure battle of wills! What passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.70,italics,Carrol,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.95,italics,Carrol,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:18.95,italics,Carrol,0,0,0,,But our opponents are just too good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.21,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Game set! The winners are...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:28.59,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The Phony pair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.46,main,Member C,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:33.09,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,You saw through all of our tricks, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:36.22,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,And despite all that, you still defeated us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:37.85,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,You crushed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:42.77,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,I think this is the first time \NI've been genuinely upset...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:46.73,main,Twain,0,0,0,,You're still young, \Nand you're clearly talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.73,0:07:48.90,main,Twain,0,0,0,,From now on, hone your craft properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.49,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll become an amazing player.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:58.16,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Twain! I'll really do my best from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:07:58.95,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:00.75,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Not only did we successfully \Ncomplete our mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:03.50,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,but he managed to reform our opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:05.38,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Impressive as ever, Twilight. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:07.25,main,Kim,0,0,0,,How stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:11.59,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,We lost this match, but we \Nstill gained something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.59,0:08:14.26,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,You've grown so much, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:16.76,main,Member A,0,0,0,,Has it sunk in just how \Nmuch you've lost yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:20.02,main,Secretary 1,0,0,0,,Sir, you have a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:22.52,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Don't ruin this moment! \NWhat's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:23.27,main,Secretary 1,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:25.65,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Our winners, the Phonys,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:29.19,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,will be presented with a piece of their \Nchoice from Mr. Campbell's collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.19,0:08:31.04,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Congratulations to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:38.67,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,This one. We'd like {\i1}Lady in the Sun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:42.71,main,Secretary 2,0,0,0,,Understood. I will go fetch \Nit from the gallery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:44.04,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:49.69,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, but that is the \None piece I cannot give you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:54.05,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,And why is that? It's clearly \Nlisted in your catalog.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:56.47,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:09:01.77,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,You can pick any other piece. \NI'll even make up the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:02.85,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Twilight...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:06.94,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I knew it. The State Security \NService just called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:10.59,main,Twain,0,0,0,,They must've caught wind of the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:12.94,main,Twain,0,0,0,,They'll be here any moment to retrieve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:15.91,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Well? You don't have to decide \Nright at this moment, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.78,0:09:21.58,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if we make our \Nchoice after seeing the actual pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.43,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Sure, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.38,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,My, how lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:32.59,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Only a select few are allowed \Nin here. You're truly lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:34.76,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Oh? Where is your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:37.39,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,His hangover was getting worse,\N so he went to lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:41.51,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,The painting is still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:43.43,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Do you have any recommendations?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:44.77,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,If {\i1}Lady in the Sun{\i0} is out of the question,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:46.89,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I was considering getting \Nsomething that isn't a painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:49.10,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:50.98,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I put my things down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:52.27,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:55.24,main,Secretary 2,0,0,0,,Sir, what about {\i1}Lady in the Sun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:57.70,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,They'll be here in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:10:01.41,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,I told them to wait in the lobby, \Nso take it out to them right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:02.12,main,Secretary 2,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:16.80,main,Security,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing? Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:19.84,main,Secretary 2,0,0,0,,It's better to make sure the piece \Nis in good condition, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:24.77,main,Security,0,0,0,,Leave it. They didn't seem like they're \Nheading here just to retrieve an art piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:30.12,main,State Security Service Officer,0,0,0,,Yes, this is definitely {\i1}Lady in the Sun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:32.27,main,State Security Service Officer,0,0,0,,Thank you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:36.65,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Oh, of course! I look forward \Nto seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:44.08,main,Secretary 2,0,0,0,,I will go see the Phonys to the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:45.58,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:49.29,main,Cavi,0,0,0,,Try seeing if they'll come play \Nfor us while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:05.47,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Should we take them up on their offer \Nand continue working for WISE?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.56,0:11:10.10,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I think I've had my fill of tennis for awhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:12.90,main,Twain,0,0,0,,What did you pick from his collection?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:16.73,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,A strange pot and some rings \Nthat are in awful taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.73,0:11:18.28,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I have no interest in either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:21.07,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I suppose we could give them \Nto the Handler as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:22.32,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:29.08,main,Twain,0,0,0,,The exhaustion hit me all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:30.87,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,But everything went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:34.42,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I did panic a bit when he said \Nhe couldn't hand it over...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:39.97,main,Twain,0,0,0,,But things worked out in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:44.43,main,Twain,0,0,0,,All because you used your \Nracket bag to sneak in a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:47.97,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,This was only possible due to your \Ntechnique in swapping them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:51.77,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,It also helped that the \Ncode wasn't in the frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:57.15,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Yes. The traces of special ink \Non the back here must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:59.76,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Let's get this to the analyst \Nteam back at HQ immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:06.33,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,The State Security Service will probably \Ncontinue searching for a code that doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:07.33,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:10.25,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Well, anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:13.46,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:19.71,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You can let me out over there, Nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:21.84,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,I'll drop you off at your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:23.68,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,So I can stay with you for \Neven a second longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:26.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm Loid Forger, a husband and father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:30.47,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I can't have our neighbors getting the \Nwrong idea about our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:34.94,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Plenty of people get reported to \Nthe Secret Police over adultery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:39.73,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Twilight... I was useful \Non our mission, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.73,0:12:42.07,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I did my best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:45.24,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I should be your rightful partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:47.03,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,It should be me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:48.74,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:55.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, see you at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:59.29,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya! Bond! We should \Nstart heading home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:00.55,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:05.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess they were playing tennis again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:14.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Nightfall?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.31,0:13:17.10,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Good evening, Mrs. Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:18.17,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:21.48,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, um... Fiona? Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:22.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's that one lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:23.86,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm back, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:25.28,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, Loid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:28.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She gave me a ride since \Nwe were going the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:30.66,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,I figured I should say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:32.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.41,0:13:36.00,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Do you play tennis, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:42.25,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya became obsessed with it after \Nwe practiced with Loid the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:44.17,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is an expert at home runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:48.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We got really far in today's \Ncompetition thanks to you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:49.68,main,Yor,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:53.47,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Hmph. You really think you helped \NTwilight raise his level?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:55.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Where are the fabulous prizes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:59.15,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,You arrogant woman. Even I could... no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:03.07,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I would've helped Twilight become \Nmore powerful far more efficiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.48,0:14:06.45,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Oh, then you must be quite \Nthe tennis player yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:09.99,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,May I request a match with you, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.03,0:14:13.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, Fiona, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:15.33,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs40\c&HB98EA8&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an1\bord1.5\fad(1,351)\move(118,290,118,270,1317,1710)\fsp1\clip(114,237,125,299)\t(1,691,\clip(114,237,555,299))}I would like to find out if
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:16.64,top,Fiona,0,0,0,,I haven't gotten quite enough\N exercise just yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.08,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs40\c&HB98EA8&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an1\bord1.5\fad(1,351)\move(95,290,95,270,1730,2000)\fsp.3\clip(75,237,100,299)\t(1,1021,\clip(75,237,585,299))}this woman is athletic enough
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.46,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs40\c&HB98EA8&\3c&HF7FFF8&\shad0\an1\bord1.5\pos(118,290)\fscx91\clip(114,237,125,299)\t(1,773,\clip(114,237,555,299))}to carry out Operation Strix.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.29,0:14:21.04,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,If you wouldn't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:22.59,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I'll crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:29.22,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I will crush your heart to the last and make \Nyou lose your place at the Forger household!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:31.51,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I didn't know my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:33.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I will let Fiona take my place as your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:34.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:35.22,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:36.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.23,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:41.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Feel free to say no, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:44.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:48.11,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I have a feeling I cannot lose \Nor run away from this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:51.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to marry someone \Nwho's really good at tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.83,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,For real? I'm awesome at tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:54.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.37,0:15:02.75,flashback,Becky,0,0,0,,Anya! Did you see this \Nweek's {\i1}Berlint in Love{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:04.75,flashback,Becky,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:09.09,flashback,Becky,0,0,0,,The protag's fiancée and his childhood \Nfriend happened to run into each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:11.80,flashback,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh! Those girls were \Nabout to have a total catfight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:14.01,flashback,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya prefers cartoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.47,0:15:18.23,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I finally understand how Becky felt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:21.15,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya loves shows about fighting, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:31.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Huff, huff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.41,0:15:40.79,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Come at me with everything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:42.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Uh, don't, Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:44.79,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Please stay out of this, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:49.55,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,She's right. It would be rude of me \Nto hold back against my opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:52.34,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll give it everything I've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.10,0:16:01.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.86,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,You disappoint me, Yor Briar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:08.23,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I knew it. You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:14.62,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I've done it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:17.87,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If I put too much strength into my swing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:21.50,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,the racket strings just cut up the ball, \Nand it crumbles into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:25.67,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Mr. Ball. \NI'm just awful at tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:29.80,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I need to give it my all, but hold back \Njust enough that the ball actually flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:32.01,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya, could you get me another ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:33.76,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Go forth, Transport Officer Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:34.39,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:38.68,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My apologies! Let's try that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:40.14,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Uh... wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:43.39,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,What in the world did I just see? \NThe ball fell to pieces? Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:45.15,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:52.15,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Faster than the speed of sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:55.07,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Its path doesn't stray even a millimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:58.74,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Oh, what a beautiful trajectory. \NIt's headed straight out of bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:00.87,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter right now, Nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:02.91,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Put your racket in front of you. Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:03.71,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,You'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:09.46,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,It's so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:11.05,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I can't push it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:12.51,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:17.72,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,But my love for Twilight is just as heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:21.18,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,This is nothing compared to all the \Nfeelings for him I've built up over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:23.81,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Forward! Bring the racket forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:26.19,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Shoot right through \NTwilight's heart, Nightfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:28.65,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Don't let this woman steal him from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:32.36,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm the one standing next\Nto Twilight in the future he envisioned!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.36,0:17:35.11,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,We'll reminisce about the hardships \Nwe faced in the living room,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:37.61,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,visit former battle sites together, \Nand retire in old age
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:39.16,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,to a neutral nation, \Nrelaxing and gazing at the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:41.45,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Ah, just thinking about it \Nis getting me excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:42.62,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,And that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:44.50,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,When it comes to being "Mrs. Forger"...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:50.21,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,You need to switch with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:02.22,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I've lost... completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:04.10,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I stood no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:06.06,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,That's why I said "don't."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.98,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you all right?! Are you hurt at all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:12.48,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,I'll admit it. Right now, \Nyou're better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:13.48,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:14.40,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:18.82,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Mrs. Forger... I request a \Nrevenge match in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:29.12,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Just go ahead and enjoy \Nyour life until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.75,0:18:32.13,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I will not give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:35.13,main,Yor,0,0,0,,D-Did I make her mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:36.67,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That lady sure is energetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:39.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I-I think she's just very \Npassionate about tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:42.47,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I hope Yor doesn't get \Ntoo suspicious over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:45.64,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Then again, this is just a marriage\N of convenience, so it doesn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:47.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:49.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:52.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, yes... Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:55.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes, you sure did!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:05.29,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm really... really tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:07.83,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:08.87,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.87,0:19:11.83,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sorry... Do you mind if we get takeout today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:21.68,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Excellent work retrieving \Nthat painting last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:23.56,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I have the results of the analysis today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:25.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hm? Where's Nightfall?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:29.84,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,She said she's holing up in the mountains \Nto work on her swing speed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:31.06,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:33.81,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,The code itself was extremely simple to crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:37.36,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,We've identified the top-secret depository,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:39.65,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,and sent our agents there \Nto retrieve the goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.65,0:19:41.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Were you able to retrieve \Nthe Zacharis Dossier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,A journal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:53.83,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,August 21st. Today, I have sealed something \Nextremely dangerous within this depository.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.21,0:19:56.84,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,Photographs of young actresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:58.59,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:01.13,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,I love all forms of theater!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:04.47,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,Though I much prefer comedic \Nmusicals to tragic operas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:07.89,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,Any production featuring young \Nladies is truly exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:10.64,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,I just feel so compelled... to support them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:12.02,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,I, uh... Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:15.15,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,I became so obsessed that my \Nwife beat me to a pulp once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:17.65,flashback,Wife,0,0,0,,How much money have you spent on this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.65,0:20:20.28,flashback,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,Er, I'm just being charitable...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:24.66,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,I even invited my wife to attend a show \Nwith me, but she just didn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.66,0:20:27.28,flashback,Wife,0,0,0,,I don't understand why they \Njust suddenly burst into song.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:32.50,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,She told me to throw all the photos away, \Nbut I just couldn't let go of the rare ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:36.75,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,Ever since then, I've kept my \Nvisits to the theater a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:38.09,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,I've buried everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:41.34,italics,Colonel Zacharis,0,0,0,,including the photos that could reignite \Nconflict, in this basement depository.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:48.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,So "reignite the flames of war"... didn't mean\N the war between the East and West.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:49.64,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Rather, between husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:52.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,How in the world would one \Nconsider this a top-secret file?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:54.14,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What was all of my hard work for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:56.15,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Right before the war ended
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.40,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,and the diplomatic corps \Nfrom the West arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:21:01.82,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Colonel Zacharis invited \Nthem out to the theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:05.74,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,But the fact that he asked them to keep \Nthat outing a secret from his wife
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:08.41,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,is probably where this all originated from.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.41,0:21:12.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No... There must be another code somewhere \Nbetween this journal and these photos!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:15.54,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,There is not. The analyst thoroughly \Nchecked every last inch of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:23.30,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,There was nothing that could reignite the war, \Nand that's more than enough this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.18,0:21:27.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.31,0:21:33.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,A picture of the colonel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.10,0:21:37.04,main,Loid,0,0,0,,"My beloved wife and daughter."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:40.19,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,After all was said and done, \Nthe colonel remained a devoted family man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.19,0:21:43.65,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,He took his secret to the grave \Nto protect his happy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:47.66,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,If he truly loved his wife and daughter, \Nhe would've tossed the photos. They're creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.66,0:21:49.66,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,Jeez, you just don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.66,0:21:53.11,main,Senior Agent,0,0,0,,This is this, and that's that. \NRare items are still rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.11,0:21:56.71,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It must be difficult to \Nmaintain a happy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:05.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's see... Can I get two each of these \Napple tarts and caramel nut cakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.98,1:00:00.00,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Loid,0,0,0,,{\pos(390,250)\fscx53}THE ROLE OF A MOTHER AND WIFE\N{\fscx73}SHOPPING WITH FRIENDS
